{"unit_id":"Mystery-God__dsh-chime#card-zh","repo":"Mystery-God/dsh-chime","commit":"40ce628d23a469cfd690c0243830371bfb6954a7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chime（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在当前会话的 agent 任务结束时播放提示音，并在设置插件页提供音量、静音和音效控制。浏览器端监听非子 agent 会话从运行转为空闲，通过 Web Audio 合成内置音效，也可播放用户上传的自定义音频。用户可以试听、上传和删除音频；设置及音频保存在本机 DSH 数据目录。适合希望在后台任务完成时及时获知、并自定义提示声音的 Web 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:306-337","lib/index.js:48-60"]}
{"unit_id":"Mystery-God__dsh-chime#card-en","repo":"Mystery-God/dsh-chime","commit":"40ce628d23a469cfd690c0243830371bfb6954a7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-chime is a DSH Web plugin that plays a sound when an agent turn completes. Its settings tab controls volume, selects built-in sounds, and manages custom audio. It watches non-subagent sessions for completion, then plays a synthesized preset or uploaded file. Settings and audio are local.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:306-337","lib/index.js:48-60"]}
